If you then back out to the activity_list view and re-open the activity, it will render with the Custom Points toggle correctly set to on.

Steps to reproduce:
1. Init Author API with a request object like so

{
    "mode": "activity_list",
    "user": {
        "id": "17b718b9-37e4-44e8-bb40-49cbb3752384"
    },
    "config": {
        "activity_edit": {
            "item": {
