    }
}


2. Create a new activity. Turn ON Custom Points, set some new point values, and save
3. Close out of Author API
4. Launch Author API with the same request object
5. Open the activity you created during step 2
6. Observe that Custom Points is incorrectly set to OFF

Is this behavior expected?

Thanks!
Pierce

